1. List schools with more than 30 difference in enrollments between K-12 and ages 5-17:
   ```sql
   SELECT CDSCode FROM frpm WHERE `Enrollment (K-12)` - `Enrollment (Ages 5-17)` > 30;
   ```

2. Get the full street address of these schools from the `schools` table:
   ```sql
   SELECT Street, StreetAbr, City, Zip FROM schools WHERE CDSCode IN (
       SELECT CDSCode FROM frpm WHERE `Enrollment (K-12)` - `Enrollment (Ages 5-17)` > 30
   );
   ```

